WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:04.240
Only horse girls who continue to win 
races and rise through the ranks

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.190
<b>races</b>

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.190
<b>races</b>

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.630
are able to enter G1 races, 
the most competitive grade of racing.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:12.860
Among those, there are two races where the 
competitors are selected by fan votes.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.360
A second Spring Tennoushou victory!

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.330
Teio... hey, your leg...

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.250
Tokai Teio-san, were you paying 
attention to the lecture?

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:53.870
<i>There's nothing left.</i>

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.970
<i>No Triple Crown, not being undefeated...</i>

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.120
<i>What am I supposed to run for now?</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:28.650
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.650
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.560
Good morning.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:40.530
Episode 6
\hSearching for a Reason

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.070
You're McQueen's...

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.360
Six months to heal?

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:56.480
Yes. It's a genuine shame I'll be unable 
to run in the Takarazuka Kinen,

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.970
but for the time being, I'll be recuperating 
at home, away from the school.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.740
I assume this means you'll be taking 
a break from your team, too.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.980
Yes. I've made sure to 
get Trainer's approval.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.870
What has Teio said about it?

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:15.010
You two are rivals, aren't you? 
You just competed in the Spring Tennoushou.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.760
The Tennoushou is over now.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:22.130
My only concern now is 
what to do in the future.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.140
I see.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.760
No horse girl can resist their 
instinct to seek victory.

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:30.170
If you'll excuse me.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.570
So... you spoke to Teio, then.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:45.950
Yes.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:51.190
Though I had thought this type of thing 
would be best conveyed in person...

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.790
No, this saves me the trouble.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.290
Let's head to our destination, Butler.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.990
Very good, miss.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.760
It's a shame about McQueen,

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.480
but Teio's injuries aren't as bad, 
so she'll be able to run again in the fall.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.930
Come on, why the long faces?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.060
McQueen's gonna be back, you hear me?

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:14.790
Yeah.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.110
Teio is working hard in spite of 
her injuries, so we'd better, too!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.740
Let's start training!

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.890
Oh yeah! Time for some 
Golshi original special training!

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.470
Let's do it, Teio!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.100
Teio-san?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.120
Oh, sorry about that! 
Yeah, let's start training.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.330
What did you want to talk about?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.790
I figured I'd run the race
plan for this fall by you.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Tokai Teio's

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Perfect Return Racing Plan!!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Tennoushou (Fall)

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
11/1 (Sunday) Tokyo Racecourse (2,000M) Left-Handed

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Japan Cup

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
11/29 (Sunday) Tokyo Racecourse (2,400M) Left-Handed

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Arima Kinen

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
12/27 Nakayama Racecourse (2,500M) Right-Handed

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
Osaka Hai

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.500
4/4 (Sunday) Hanshin Racecourse (2,200M) Right-Handed

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.620
Looks good to me.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.680
That's kind of what I was figuring, anyway.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.570
How's your leg doing? If it's hurting...

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:50.780
It's fine. I was able to 
train normally, wasn't I?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.390
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.950
Okay, I'm gonna go, then.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.790
Training normally, huh?

