00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.630
It's been a very intense racing season.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.580
It definitely has, with a lot of drama.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.700
You got it from here!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:14.040
<b>Takarazuka Kinen</b>

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.380
Mejiro Palmer in front! Kania Curation behind her!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.040
Leave it to me!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.860
But there's no catching Palmer!

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.020
Because we're BFFs!

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:15.830
And just now—

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.400
She crosses the goal!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.130
In McQueen's absence, Palmer has
 won the Takarazuka Kinen!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.470
I did it, Trainer!

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.130
Huh? Trainer?!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.880
<b>Today's Special Guest</b>

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.880
<b>The Ultim-Outrunner Horse Girl!</b>

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.880
<b>Mejiro Palmer</b>

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.360
<i>Our guest today is Mejiro Palmer-san,</i>

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:26.540
<i>who came away with a splendid 
win at the Takarazuka Kinen.</i>

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.720
<i>What are your thoughts now, 
looking back on the race?</i>

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.350
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.710
<i>I think at the Tennoushou, I wasn't prepared 
enough for how much I'd have to run.</i>

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:31.980
Palmer!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:35.000
Palmer, Palmer!

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:36.440
<i>But during the Takarazuka, 
I could tell Helios was behind me,</i>

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.800
<i>going as hard as she could,</i>

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:42.650
<b>Mejiro Palmer</b>

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.360
<i>and that made me able to run even more.</i>

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.650
Oh, wow! She mentioned me!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:47.280
<i>I think having someone like a rival 
to compete with is really awesome!</i>

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.530
Palmer...

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:52.150
<i>Now that I've got a BFF... 
no, a running friend,</i>

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.740
<i>I know I can win next time!</i>

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.140
<i>Thank you so much.</i>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.670
<i>And coming soon is the 
next race in the classics.</i>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.850
<b>Today's Special Guest</b>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.850
<b>The Ultim-Outrunner Horse Girl!</b>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.850
<b>Mejiro Palmer</b>

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.210
<i>Without a doubt, all eyes are
going to be on Mihono Bourbon.</i>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.210
<b>Racer Profile!</b>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.210
<b>Racer Profile!</b>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.210
<b>Racer Profile!</b>

